# Route: guide 3 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 14 to 17, 53
# quests, 3.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Durotar): Valley of Trials -> Razor Hill -> Tiragarde Keep -> Sen'jin
# Village -> Echo Isles -> Sen'jin Village -> Kolkar Crag -> Valley of Trials
# -> Tiragarde Keep -> Razormane Grounds -> Valley of Trials -> Sen'jin
# Village -> Razor Hill -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Ukor's Lost Pack (96876; Ukorsbane
# 8); Halikor's Hoof (96877; Halikor 12); Threat from Below (99052; Aggor the
# Young 11).
