# Blacksmithing; 97901 Camping 101: Enchanting; 97902 Camping 101:
# Engineering; 97903 Camping 101: First Aid; 97904 Camping 101: Fishing; 97905
# Camping 101: Herbalism; 97906 Camping 101: Leatherworking; 97907 Camping
# 101: Mining; 97908 Camping 101: Skinning.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

